cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: gnuplot.vim
abstract: >-
  Syntax highlighting for gnuplot 6 in Vim and Neovim. The keyword lists are
  generated from the tree-sitter-gnuplot dictionary, so both projects recognise
  the same words with the same abbreviation rules, and under Neovim the
  highlight groups link to the same treesitter captures the grammar uses.
type: software
